==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Doge]]s spawn after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>, delay 26.67~33.33 seconds<sup>800f~1,000f</sup>.
*5 [[Snache]]s spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 20~26.67 seconds<sup>600f~800f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 90% HP:
**1 [[Doge]] spawns as the boss.
**2 [[Those Guys]] spawn after 1.67 seconds<sup>50f</sup>, delay 4~8 seconds<sup>120f~240f</sup>.
**3 [[Those Guys]] spawn, delay 2~4 seconds<sup>60f~120f</sup>.

==Strategy==
A very easy stage that any unit can beat. Bring any of the [[:Category:Normal Cats|Normal Cats]] to win.

